 "request": "Totoy sets a spirit lantern down at his feet; for about 5 s it glows and pulses; while Totoy stands in its light each pulse heals a little and gives Edge. Duration, pulse rate, radius, heal and Edge amounts are owner/core decisions.",
 "groups": {
  "fx_lantern_place_<1..4>": "32x32, anchor (16,29) = the lantern's ground point. 1 dropping in (unlit, speed lines; the lantern is 6 px up), 2 lands: ignition flash and dust burst, 3 dust spreads, sparks, small flame, 4 dust thins, flame up. Then loop idle.",
  "fx_lantern_idle_<1..6>": "32x32, anchor (16,29). Burning loop: the teal-white flame flickers (height and lean), lilac tip on 2 and 5, motes rise off the cap. About 110 ms per frame.",
  "fx_lantern_pulse_<1..4>": "32x32, anchor (16,29). One pulse: 1 flare, 2 burst (white glass, 8 rays), 3 rays out and breaking, 4 settle. Play on each core pulse, then back to idle.",
  "fx_lantern_fade_<1..6>": "32x32, anchor (16,29). Extinguish: 1-3 the flame shrinks and cools with a lilac smoke wisp, 4 unlit, 5 the lantern dissolves (dither) into motes, 6 last motes. The lantern is gone after 6.",
  "fx_lantern_pool_open_<1..3>": "64x32, anchor (32,16) = the same ground point as the lantern. Ground decal, draw UNDER every character. The pool opens from the lantern with a bright edge (with place 2-4).",
  "fx_lantern_pool_idle_<1..4>": "64x32, anchor (32,16). Dithered teal floor glow (rx 29, ry 12: about 58x24 px) with a dashed rim that drifts; loop about 140 ms per frame. Scale is illustrative: the real radius is the core's.",
  "fx_lantern_pool_pulse_<1..5>": "64x32, anchor (32,16). The pulse ring: 1 flash at the lantern, 2-4 a bright ring sweeps out, 5 it breaks on the rim. Starts with fx_lantern_pulse_1.",
  "fx_lantern_heal_<1..6>": "32x40, anchor (16,38) = Totoy's feet. Plays over Totoy on a pulse while he stands in the light: teal ring at the feet, plus-sparkles and wisps rise and fade. Draw over the hero.",
  "fx_lantern_edge_<1..6>": "32x32, anchor (16,16) = Totoy's chest/weapon hand (about feet + (2,-15) on the idle frames). Cream sparks with lilac tails (the HUD Edge colour) stream in and pop. Start it 1-2 frames after fx_lantern_heal_1."
